    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes surface underway data collected from R/V Marcus G. Langseth Expeditions in the South Pacific Ocean and Tasman Sea from 2018-01-06 to 2018-03-19. These data include partial pressure (or fugacity) of carbon dioxide (pCO2) - water, sea surface salinity, sea surface temperature and barometric pressure. The instruments used to collect these data include Carbon dioxide (CO2) gas analyzer and shower head chamber equilibrator for autonomous carbon dioxide (CO2) measurement.",
